Z||000000||isthiswhereiputausername?||11-15-2001||02:28 PM||||Who would be willing to donate their plastic model kit of their fiero to a worthwhile project?<P>I recieved a email back again from Sherman regarding the fiero kits:<P>"Is there any accurate plastic kits available in the market so that we can use it as reference?"<P><BR>Does anyone have one from every year  or could you please post what plastic kits you have and with what options?(wing/tbar/targa,etc)<P><BR>Lets all help try to get these kits manufactured!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>Anyone that dont know what we are talking about, read CoolBlue87GT's post here<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011712.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/011712.html</A> <P>||||reg||5
